  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b7b72a809a05de42b9e4e1a9fc3d116, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F981\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Hopes for courage
  _description: Roars at everyone so they run away, and is afraid of all of them.
    He carries the friends across the ditches of the forest but falls asleep in the
    [[ba69a581-8516-409c-b993-4802f3562380|Deadly Poppy Field]]. Later he becomes
    King of the Beasts.
